# Dancing Stage - Internet Ranking Ver (GC845 VER. EBA): the first power-on, as ddr2m-boot.his. The
# 573 BIOS boots the CD and the game asks "DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?" (by frame 600):
# Test answers yes, and the game copies itself from the CD to the onboard flash. Hashes the main
# RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game dstage

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 12000 quit
